    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "2593e042bdc03b572431": "Ah yes, another who will stoke the fires and forge the weapons of war. Of course I will teach you how.",
        "4b904265915addb1d23c": "Train me.",
        "5156d666416e6ccc12ae": "Your interruption is costing me valuable time, this had better be good.",
        "83f7dee36b36e968bbc1": "You have learned well my child. Go to the Undercity, find a smith named James Van Brunt. He will be able to teach you much that I cannot. I understand he spends his time near the Warriors training hall, forging their weapons and armor."
      },
      "name": "Guillaume Sorouy",
      "subName": "Journeyman Blacksmith",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
